> 0:2345:respawn:/sbin/mingetty ttyS0
> 
> Perhaps try replacing your inittab entry with the above, you say it worked,
> but now it doesn't, what have you changed on your machine?

man mingetty says:

DESCRIPTION
       mingetty  is  a minimal getty for use on virtual consoles.
       Unlike agetty(8), mingetty  is  not  suitable  for  serial
       lines.  I recommend using mgetty(8) for this purpose.

So, mingetty cannot be used to establish a serial console.

> Hmmm, a 'which mgetty' or 'man mgetty'
> on my machine cannot find such a binary.

Maybe you haven't installed the mgetty rpm?

