-Would "normal" programs see the same type of performance boast by recompiling
using CCC ? Or is this typical to benchmarks ?
-Is GCC being maintained actively (wrt alpha's) and will it get better for RISC
cpu's ?
-Are CCC and GCC fully compatible ?


